request.description:
Process up to **10 payments** in a single invocation. Non-atomic: each item is processed independently. See [docs/batch-payments.md](batch-payments.md) for full details on partial failures, error codes, and idempotent re-submission.

**Max batch size:** 10 items

**Expected response (per-item results):**
```json
{
  "results": [
    { "order_id": "ORDER_001", "status": "success" },
    { "order_id": "ORDER_002", "status": "error", "code": "InvalidSignature" },
    { "order_id": "ORDER_003", "status": "success" }
  ]
}
```

**Errors (per-item):** `InvalidSignature`, `DuplicateOrderId`, `MerchantNotFound`, `BatchTooLarge`

